### LinkedIn Jobs API - REST Client File
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/linkedin

### 1. Search LinkedIn Jobs (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keywords": "AI ML Engineer, Full Stack, Accenture, Wipro, TCS, Capgemini",
  "locations": "Hyderabad",
  "posted_within": "7d",
  "offset": 0,
  "limit": 15
}

###

### 2. Search LinkedIn Jobs (GET with Query Parameters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/search?keywords=Python%20Developer&location=Remote&posted_within=24h&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get LinkedIn Job Details & Description by Job ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/job/4468221669
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Job Search Agent Chat - Initial Message / Preference Gathering
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "job_agent_session_01",
  "message": "Hi, I am looking for Remote Python Developer positions posted in the last 24h. Can you search for them?"
}

###

### 5. Job Search Agent Chat - HITL Selection (Fetching Full Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "job_agent_session_01",
  "message": "Can you fetch full details and required skills for job ID 4468221669?"
}

###

### 6. Get Job Agent Real-time Session Events (Delta Records & Thinking/Tool Call Updates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/events/job_agent_session_01
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Get Job Agent Persistent Status Logs from DB
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/logs/job_agent_session_01
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Generate Centrifugo Connection JWT Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/centrifugo/token?user_id=user_demo
Accept: application/json


